# the driver: one pass, one row or a whole schedule over a module
#
# a pass that refuses leaves every function as it was: the driver snapshots
# each body before the pass may touch it, puts the snapshot back on a refusal
# and gives it back otherwise, so no pass has to take back its own edits.
# after a pass changes a function, every analysis it does not preserve is
# dropped. a checked run verifies the module after every pass.

